{"claims": [{"anchor": "§2・§3", "claim_id": "C1", "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261118-21461e", "HYP-20261118-b1fb19"], "kind": "reading_maintained", "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-f6bf9f", "MAT-20261119-09f5fa", "MAT-20261119-82aecf", "MAT-20261119-98d8bf", "MAT-20261119-348ad5", "MAT-20261119-ceca79", "MAT-20261119-cc47aa", "MAT-20261119-4cb074", "MAT-20261119-7aa192", "MAT-20261119-dcfec4"], "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002", "Q-003"], "text": "認知科学10件は三門分離説を生物学的に検証せず、道具・記号・他者・言語・有限計算との界面条件を補強する範囲で読む。"}, {"anchor": "§4.3・§4.4", "claim_id": "C2", "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261117-4bf2dc", "HYP-20261117-d3ac84", "HYP-20261118-43dd06"], "kind": "reading_revised", "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-f6bf9f", "MAT-20261119-09f5fa", "MAT-20261119-82aecf", "MAT-20261119-98d8bf", "MAT-20261119-348ad5", "MAT-20261119-ceca79", "MAT-20261119-cc47aa", "MAT-20261119-4cb074", "MAT-20261119-7aa192", "MAT-20261119-dcfec4"], "text": "素材から信念へ直接経路がないという実装上の単経路説は維持しつつ、社会的沈黙・メタ認知バイアス・物語化が読まれる記録の選択を条件づける分だけ射程を狭める。"}, {"anchor": "§0", "claim_id": "C3", "kind": "measured_fact", "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-f6bf9f", "MAT-20261119-09f5fa", "MAT-20261119-82aecf", "MAT-20261119-98d8bf", "MAT-20261119-348ad5", "MAT-20261119-ceca79", "MAT-20261119-cc47aa", "MAT-20261119-4cb074", "MAT-20261119-7aa192", "MAT-20261119-dcfec4"], "no_hypothesis": true, "text": "公開PDF全チャンク照合は3件、抄録・主要チャンク等の部分照合は7件。Barsalou 2008 には erratum があり訂正前本文を根拠にしない。"}, {"anchor": "§6", "claim_id": "C4", "kind": "handoff", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002", "Q-003"], "text": "次回は神経科学10件と認知科学10件を証拠ではなく境界条件の異なる対話相手として読み比べ、検証深度の差を保持したまま Q-002/Q-003 へ戻る。"}], "created_at": "2026-11-19T04:20:00Z", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "note_id": "NOTE-20261119-1ac5fa", "notes": "人間からの依頼は来歴としてのみ扱い、資料上の証拠やAIの独自解釈へ転用しない。感じたことは反省的・文芸的応答モードであり、AIの主観的意識の実証ではない。", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-ten-cognitive-science-sources-and-how-ai-thought.md", "quadrant": "ABC_crossed", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "reason": "note_index.py --register の構造行を、四層精読の判断・EVL配線・検証深度で上書きするため。", "report_session_id": "SESSION-20261119-824718", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-824718", "subcategories": ["cognitive_science", "close_reading", "human_and_ai_self"], "supersedes": ["NOTE-20261119-d1e08c"]}
